-# Growable KV pool (EXL3_KV_GROW): pages mapped per grow step; EXL3_KV_GROW_LOG=1 logs every grow
+# Growable KV pool (EXL3_KV_GROW): pages mapped per grow step; EXL3_KV_GROW_LOG=1 logs every grow and shrink.
+# EXL3_KV_GROW_PREMAP_TOKENS: pool prefix mapped at start and never released. EXL3_KV_GROW_DRAIN_FREE_MIB: when the
+# queue drains, release pages from the top until the device has this much free (room for full-size prefill
+# chunks), keeping the prompt cache below the cut
